description:
Source-backed identifier selected by `identity_kind` (conversation,
session, request, trace, and so on). This is a copy/display value only;
clients must continue to use opaque `id` for detail reads.

Correlated finding detections attributed to the topic's windows.
`None` while the finding mirror is cold (unknown, not "clean");
an empty list means the mirror is warm and found nothing.

Spend by identified user, cost-descending, then the `Other users`
and `Unattributed` folds (gateway logs rarely carry a user email;
the folds keep the list reconciling to the headline spend).
